Third-party material
--------------------
Parts of this repository are adapted from RealPDEBench
(https://github.com/AI4Science-WestlakeU/RealPDEBench, commit 62f4c80ab17f78933d046f2b038531dbc6a478a0),
which is licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0. The RealPDEBench paper: "RealPDEBench: A Benchmark for Complex
Physical Systems with Real-World Data", ICLR 2026 (arXiv:2601.01829).

Adapted files and the changes made:

  pilfm/fast_dataset.py
      Subclass of realpdebench.data.fluid_hf_dataset.CylinderHFDataset. The sample construction of the
      official __getitem__ (channel stacking, mask draw, noise draws and their order) is copied line for
      line; changed: frames are sliced directly from the memory-mapped Arrow buffer instead of
      materializing a whole trajectory row, and an optional on-disk cache of the subsampled trajectories.

  pilfm/official_eval.py
      The test loop of realpdebench/eval.py (lines 290-352) and the validation loop of
      realpdebench/train.py (lines 345-373), re-implemented so that any predictor can be evaluated;
      changed: the predictor is a parameter, datasets are shared across checkpoints. Metrics are computed
      by the unmodified official realpdebench.utils.metrics.eval_metrics.

  configs/cylinder/*.yaml
      Official RealPDEBench cylinder configs; changed: dataset/results paths, seed, num_workers,
      exp_name suffix, finetune checkpoint_path (see docs/DECISIONS.md, D-018).

  patches/official_62f4c80_fluid_hf_dataset_sim_id_column.patch
      A local modification of the official realpdebench/data/fluid_hf_dataset.py, recorded as a diff.

The official package itself is not included; it is installed separately and used unmodified
(apart from the patch above).

Data and checkpoints
--------------------
No data or model checkpoints are included. The RealPDEBench dataset is distributed by its authors on
Hugging Face (AI4Science-WestlakeU/RealPDEBench) under CC BY-NC 4.0 and must be obtained from there.
